    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Wondrous Item, Rare (Requires Attunement)</em></p><p>While wearing this cloak, you gain the following benefits.</p><p><strong>Shocking Feedback.</strong> The cloak has 3 charges and regains all expended charges daily at dawn. You can expend 1 charge to cast @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplHellishReb]{Hellish Rebuke} (save DC 13) from the cloak; the spell deals your choice of Lightning or Thunder damage instead of Fire damage.</p><p><strong>Storm Resistance.</strong> You have Resistance to Lightning and Thunder damage.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-vgMGkxWgKiyVlvW1\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p><em>Shocking Feedback</em> reproduit <em>Hellish Rebuke</em> (niveau 1) avec les dégâts de foudre ou de tonnerre au choix.</p></section>",
